    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rhythm Realm",
    "steam_appid": 2360870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/b1eca206e922749264aa704e382b68b4.avif?t=1740121304\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Euteria\u2014otherwise known as the &quot;RHYTHM REALM&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigs talk, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olives walk, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the muses watch over everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Jim Gino</strong>, a mute boy with a special sword and the power to sense rhythm in his enemies' movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.poster.avif?t=1740121304\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.webm?t=1740121304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.mp4?t=1740121304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Rhythm Realm, You will Experience...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battles in the form of a rhythm minigame, all accompanied by an original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A 15-20 hour adventure with many sidequests, hidden areas, and rabbit holes to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A colorful world with both familiar and bizarre environments. Go from humble farmlands to the top of a leaning tower, monster-infested lakes, and interdimensional doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zany characters and dialogue: talking animals, tomatoes, rocks--you name it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Handy items from a shady salesman and powerful blessings from the Muses to aid players who lack rhythm in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles ranging from small brain to slightly-larger than average brain </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spaghetti and meatballs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Italian Santa Claus</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING! Rhythm Realm Does <strong>NOT</strong> Contain</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level grinding </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escort quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Excessive backtracking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Microtransactions </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/b1eca206e922749264aa704e382b68b4.avif?t=1740121304\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Euteria\u2014otherwise known as the &quot;RHYTHM REALM&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pigs talk, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olives walk, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the muses watch over everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Jim Gino</strong>, a mute boy with a special sword and the power to sense rhythm in his enemies' movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.poster.avif?t=1740121304\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.webm?t=1740121304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360870/extras/3baf48d0497263dfaf95d5d0034ead44.mp4?t=1740121304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Rhythm Realm, You will Experience...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battles in the form of a rhythm minigame, all accompanied by an original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A 15-20 hour adventure with many sidequests, hidden areas, and rabbit holes to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A colorful world with both familiar and bizarre environments. Go from humble farmlands to the top of a leaning tower, monster-infested lakes, and interdimensional doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zany characters and dialogue: talking animals, tomatoes, rocks--you name it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Handy items from a shady salesman and powerful blessings from the Muses to aid players who lack rhythm in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles ranging from small brain to slightly-larger than average brain </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spaghetti and meatballs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pet rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Italian Santa Claus</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING! Rhythm Realm Does <strong>NOT</strong> Contain</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level grinding </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escort quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Excessive backtracking </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Microtransactions </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: Game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "The lizardman mob boss condemned your village to a slow, catchy death. One boy, one sword: do you have what it takes to venture through this magical world of music and save them all?",
